    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Create a flowchart to implement **one** of the following rules:\r\n\r\n   a. A student can join the team only if they meet the grade requirement **AND** meet the attendance requirement.\r\n\r\n   b. A student can join the team if they meet the grade requirement **OR** meet the attendance requirement. \r\n\r\n2. Save your flowchart to your **Backpack**.\r\n",
